   SVS FORTRAN V2.8
9) Intel Modular Platform, 256 kB write-back cache, 32 MB RAM,
   AT&T UNIX System V R4.0.4, Metaware High C R2.4b,
   Intel Scheduling FORTRAN 77 Compiler V0.2
