at speeds other than 2400 and 38400 baud. I wonder why noone has
noticed this one... Anyways, here's a patch that should fix this. 
Thanks, Rudy!

diff /usr/src/net-010/dip/serial.c /usr/src/net-010/dip/serial.c.orig
246c246,247
<   tty.c_cflag |= ((tty.c_cflag & ~CBAUD) | baud);
